# ============================================================================
# Whitelist .gitignore — publish ONLY the selected set; ignore everything else.
# Strategy: ignore every root entry with `/*`, then re-include (`!`) what ships.
# ============================================================================

# Ignore everything at the repo root by default
/*

# ---- Top-level files to publish ----
!/.gitignore
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/INSTALL.md
!/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
!/pyproject.toml
!/pyrightconfig.json
!/uv.lock
# Agent-facing entry point. CLAUDE.md is deliberately NOT published — it is local working
# instruction, not part of the distributed toolkit.
!/CONTEXT.md

# ---- Claude Code plugin: `/plugin marketplace add akontadakis/hcl-mcp` ----
# `.mcp.json` is the plugin's server declaration; it doubles as a ready-to-use
# project MCP config for anyone who clones this repo directly.
!/.mcp.json
!/.claude-plugin/

# ---- Source and tests (entire trees) ----
!/src/
!/tests/

# ---- Validation kit (docs + BYO-data inputs); generated run outputs stay ignored ----
!/hcl_validation/
/hcl_validation/results/work/

# ---- Claude Code: ship only the validation tester subagent ----
!/.claude/
/.claude/*
!/.claude/agents/

# ---- Claude Code: auto-triggered skills ----
!/skills/
/skills/*
!/skills/running-hcl-studies/

# ---- docs/ — only the selected subset ----
!/docs/
/docs/*
# Coefficient provenance: publish ONLY the CCM coefficient CSV. tests/test_sedes1_data.py
# locks src/hcl_core/_sedes1_fig11.csv against it, so it must ship or the suite fails on a
# clean clone. The digitisation notes, reconstruction PNGs, dashboard and source PDFs stay local.
!/docs/Coefficient provenance/
/docs/Coefficient provenance/*
!/docs/Coefficient provenance/fig11_CCM_coefficients.csv
# Figures: publish ONLY the deep-dive set that spectral-engine-radiance-deep-dive.md embeds.
# The BE-manuscript figures and the site icons are local-only.
!/docs/img/
/docs/img/*
!/docs/img/spectral-deep-dive/
# The P3 errata record — every claim the P0-P2 rebuild falsified, and the corrected figure —
# is NOT in this tree: it lives with its source data outside the published repo, and P3-G4
# (the gate that used to assert its contents) moved out with it. The suite passes without it.
!/docs/engines-install.md
!/docs/hcl-methodology.md
!/docs/literature-bibliography.md
!/docs/operating-guide.md
!/docs/radiance-6-build.md
!/docs/recalibrating-cloud-ccm.md
!/docs/smarts-build.md
!/docs/spectral-engines.md
!/docs/spectral-engine-comparison.md
!/docs/spectral-engine-radiance-deep-dive.md
!/docs/spectral-engine-validation.md
!/docs/spectral-sky-as-built.md
!/docs/spectral-sky-methodology.md
!/docs/technical-reference.md
# Manuscript drafts and their whole toolchain stay local: the .md sources, their built
# .docx, the build script, and the reference.docx style template it needs.
# docs/reference/ (the CIE S 026 toolbox) is likewise local. All covered by `/docs/*` above.

# ---- docs/validation/ ----
# Not published, and no rule below re-includes it: the measurement dossiers moved to the
# outer _data/ tree on 2026-08-10 and are covered by the `/docs/*` ignore-all above. The
# long allowlist that used to live here (open-data/, the luminaire assets, the campaign trees)
# went with them. Nothing under src/ or tests/ imports that tree; the one file tests did read
# (the SEDES2 coefficient CSV) now lives in tests/fixtures/ beside its test.

# ---- Agent-workflow docs (referenced from CONTEXT.md) + ADRs ----
!/docs/adr/

# ============================================================================
# Always-ignore junk (also inside the whitelisted trees above)
# ============================================================================
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# gensdaymtx per-AOD atmosphere cache (generated on first live run)
atmos_data/

# Local-only tooling / scratch — not pushed
.superpowers/
.git-rewrite/

# ---- docs/Literature is entirely local: source PDFs, the methodology database and its _build
# pipeline are all unpublished. Covered by the `/docs/*` rule above; stated here explicitly so the
# next person does not re-add a whitelist for it. ----

# docs/agents/ moved to the outer repo 2026-08-10 — agent-development notes are
# not published. Covered by the `/docs/*` ignore-all above.

.whetstone-mcp/
